## Standup config

Copy this file to `config.local.md` (gitignored) and fill in your own values.

- **GitHub username**: `your-github-handle`
- **GitHub repo**: `org/repo`
- **Linear team**: Team Name (ID: `<team-uuid>`)
- **Linear user**: you@example.com (ID: `<user-uuid>`, assignee name: `your-linear-handle`)
